		"name": "WPA3 PSK",
		"description": "### **Site Management - WPA3 PSK**\n\n#### Use Case:\n\nAn administrator wants to set up a secure Wi-Fi network with a WPA3 PSK (Wi-Fi Protected Access 3 - Pre-Shared Key). The **WPA3 PSK** workflow focuses on creating and managing WPA3 PSKs for sites. This includes creating WPA3 PSKs, associating them with roles, assigning them to specific sites, and managing role-based policies and policy groups.\n\n---\n\n#### **Key Functionalities**:\n\n- Define a WPA3 PSK SSID with specific properties such as name, encryption type, and associated roles.\n    \n- Link a WPA3 PSK SSID to a specific site for enabling secure Wi-Fi access.\n    \n- Create roles and assign them to sites or WPA3 PSKs for access control.\n    \n- Define role-based policies and assign them to sites for enforcing access control rules.\n    \n- Group multiple policies together for easier management and application.\n    \n\n---\n\n#### **Relevant POST Requests**:\n\n1. **Create Role**: Creates a role that can be associated with a WPA3 PSK SSID.\n    \n2. **Assign Role to Site**: Assigns a role to a specific site for access control.\n    \n3. **Create Role-Based Policy**: Creates a role-based policy with specific rules and descriptions.\n    \n4. **Add to Policy Groups**: Adds a role-based policy to a policy group for easier management.\n    \n5. **Assign Role-Based Policy to Site**: Assigns a role-based policy to a specific site.\n    \n6. **Create WPA3 PSK SSID w/ Role**: Creates a WPA3 PSK SSID with properties such as name, encryption type, and associated roles.\n    \n7. **Assign WPA3 PSK SSID to Site**: Assigns a WPA3 PSK SSID to a specific site.\n    \n\n---\n\n#### **Steps**:\n\n1. **Create a Role**: Use the `Create Role` request to define roles for access control.\n    \n2. **Assign the Role to a Site**: Use the `Assign Role to Site` request to associate the role with a specific site.\n    \n3. **Create a Role-Based Policy**: Use the `Create Role-Based Policy` request to define a policy with specific rules.\n    \n4. **Add the Policy to a Group**: Use the `Add to Policy Groups` request to group the policy with others for easier management.\n    \n5. **Assign the Role-Based Policy to a Site**: Use the `Assign Role-Based Policy to Site` request to apply the policy to a specific site.\n    \n6. **Create a WPA3 PSK SSID**: Use the `Create WPA3 PSK w/ Role` request to define the SSID properties and associate it with roles.\n    \n7. **Assign the WPA3 PSK SSID to a Site**: Use the `Assign WPA3 PSK to Site` request to link the SSID to a specific site.\n    \n\n---\n\n#### **API Automation Opportunities**:\n\n- Automate the creation of roles and their assignment to sites.\n    \n- Automate the creation and assignment of role-based policies to sites.\n    \n- Automate the grouping of policies for streamlined management.\n    \n- Automate the creation and assignment of WPA3 PSKs to sites for secure Wi-Fi access.\n    \n\n---",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
